{"id":"ccca4694302f2a15","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/776_Post_n_值逻辑_P_n.md","title":"776 Post n 值逻辑 P n","display":"776_Post_n_值逻辑_P_n","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"776-Post-n-值逻辑-P_n\">776 Post n 值逻辑 P_n</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-参数与符号表\">1. 参数与符号表</h1>\n<p>固定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\n\\operatorname{cyc},\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\n\\operatorname{cyc},\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cyc}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cyc}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p,\\qquad \\mathbf 0,\\qquad \\mathbf 1,\\qquad N A,\\qquad A\\vee B,\\qquad A\\wedge B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p,\\qquad \\mathbf 0,\\qquad \\mathbf 1,\\qquad N A,\\qquad A\\vee B,\\qquad A\\wedge B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cyc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{cyc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{one})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{one})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\}\\)</span>，并令替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{P_n}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{P_n}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 送到唯一满足下列递归等式的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{P_n}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{P_n}(\\sigma)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{zero},\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{one},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{zero},\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{one},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{cyc}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{cyc}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{P_n}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,P_n}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{P_n}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,P_n}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{P_n}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,P_n}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{P_n}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,P_n}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-Post-n-值矩阵\">4. Post n 值矩阵</h1>\n<p>真值集合与指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{P_n}=\\{k\\in\\mathbb N:k&lt;n\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{P_n}=\\{n-1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{P_n}=\\{k\\in\\mathbb N:k&lt;n\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{P_n}=\\{n-1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>常元解释为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0_{P_n}=0,\\qquad \\mathbf1_{P_n}=n-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0_{P_n}=0,\\qquad \\mathbf1_{P_n}=n-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_{P_n}:\\mathsf V_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\vee_{P_n},\\wedge_{P_n}:\\mathsf V_{P_n}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_{P_n}:\\mathsf V_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\vee_{P_n},\\wedge_{P_n}:\\mathsf V_{P_n}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义循环否定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_{P_n}(a)=\n\\begin{cases}\na+1,&amp;a&lt;n-1,\\\\\n0,&amp;a=n-1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_{P_n}(a)=\n\\begin{cases}\na+1,&amp;a&lt;n-1,\\\\\n0,&amp;a=n-1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义格运算：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\vee_{P_n}b=\\max(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\wedge_{P_n}b=\\min(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\vee_{P_n}b=\\max(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\wedge_{P_n}b=\\min(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n}\">\\(\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf V_{P_n}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{zero})=\\mathbf0_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{one})=\\mathbf1_{P_n},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{zero})=\\mathbf0_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{one})=\\mathbf1_{P_n},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=N_{P_n}(\\overline v(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=N_{P_n}(\\overline v(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{P_n}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{P_n}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{P_n}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{P_n}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{P_n})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{P_n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{P_n})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{P_n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{P_n}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{P_n}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{P_n}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{P_n}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{P_n}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{P_n}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P_n}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P_n}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{P_n}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{P_n}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{P_n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{P_n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{P_n}\">\\(\\Vdash_{P_n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P_n}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P_n}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P_n}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P_n}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是 Post 有限矩阵语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{P_n}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n},\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n},\\operatorname{BV}_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n},\\operatorname{Ext}_{P_n},\\equiv_{\\alpha,P_n},\n\\mathsf V_{P_n},\\mathsf D_{P_n},\\mathbf0_{P_n},\\mathbf1_{P_n},\nN_{P_n},\\vee_{P_n},\\wedge_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n},\n\\Vdash_{P_n},\\mathsf{Valid}_{P_n},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P_n}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{P_n}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n},\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P_n},\\operatorname{BV}_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{P_n},\\operatorname{Ext}_{P_n},\\equiv_{\\alpha,P_n},\n\\mathsf V_{P_n},\\mathsf D_{P_n},\\mathbf0_{P_n},\\mathbf1_{P_n},\nN_{P_n},\\vee_{P_n},\\wedge_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{P_n},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P_n},\n\\Vdash_{P_n},\\mathsf{Valid}_{P_n},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P_n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P_n}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是有限 Post 链上的循环否定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{P_n}\">\\(N_{P_n}\\)</span>；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不含 Łukasiewicz 或 Gödel 蕴含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"776-Post-n-值逻辑-P_n","text":"776 Post n 值逻辑 P_n","level":1},{"id":"1.-参数与符号表","text":"1. 参数与符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-Post-n-值矩阵","text":"4. Post n 值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\n\\operatorname{cyc},\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cyc}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\qquad \\mathbf 0,\\qquad \\mathbf 1,\\qquad N A,\\qquad A\\vee B,\\qquad A\\wedge B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{P_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\math